30:05.920 --> 30:06.700
you know the horizon

30:06.700 --> 30:08.540
has totally warped the geometry

30:08.540 --> 30:10.520
and the model is actively drifting

30:10.520 --> 30:11.860
toward a biased fixed point.

30:12.080 --> 30:12.680
SGD. Exactly.

30:13.260 --> 30:14.560
It is a really brilliant way

30:14.560 --> 30:15.860
to bridge the network theory

30:15.860 --> 30:17.120
of the first half of the paper

30:17.120 --> 30:18.560
with the optimization geometry

30:18.560 --> 30:19.440
