31:03.900 --> 31:04.380
SGD. Yes.

31:04.560 --> 31:05.780
It is permanently bound

31:05.780 --> 31:06.820
to the newly generated

31:06.820 --> 31:07.840
successor checkpoint.

31:08.220 --> 31:09.640
So it doesn't just present

31:09.640 --> 31:10.440
the final weights

31:10.440 --> 31:11.440
of the neural network.

31:11.440 --> 31:12.580
It actually carries

31:12.580 --> 31:13.800
the cryptographic proof

31:13.800 --> 31:15.480
of the entire historical

31:15.480 --> 31:16.940
and mathematical supply chain

31:16.940 --> 31:18.160
that generated those weights.

31:18.580 --> 31:18.600
SGD. Okay.

31:18.700 --> 31:20.720
So what exactly does it prove?

31:21.340 --> 31:22.240
SGD. At the protocol level,

31:22.680 --> 31:23.780
the certificate asserts

31:23.780 --> 31:25.060
four definitive claims.

31:25.480 --> 31:26.200
First, origin.

31:26.620 --> 31:27.740
It cryptographically binds

31:27.740 --> 31:28.380
every shift

31:28.380 --> 31:29.400
