31:29.400 --> 31:30.320
that generated it.

31:30.540 --> 31:30.680
SGD. Okay.

31:30.920 --> 31:32.000
Second, uniqueness.

31:32.600 --> 31:34.080
It utilizes the disjoint

31:34.080 --> 31:35.040
tag sets we discussed

31:35.040 --> 31:36.640
to prove that no single update

31:36.640 --> 31:37.520
was double counted

31:37.520 --> 31:38.400
in the routing graph.

31:38.500 --> 31:38.780
SGD. Essential.

31:39.500 --> 31:40.400
Third, eligibility.

31:41.020 --> 31:41.800
It proves that

31:41.800 --> 31:42.700
the aggregated data

31:42.700 --> 31:43.780
satisfied the specific

31:43.780 --> 31:44.720
quorum policies

31:44.720 --> 31:45.360
of that round.

31:45.520 --> 31:45.720
SGD. Right.

31:45.760 --> 31:46.340
The voting rules.

31:46.780 --> 31:47.920
And fourth, closure.

31:48.320 --> 31:49.620
It provides the definitive,

31:49.940 --> 31:50.800
unalterable verdict

31:50.800 --> 31:51.660
of which nodes

31:51.660 --> 31:52.180
were included

31:52.180 --> 31:52.960
in the data set

31:52.960 --> 31:54.520
and which were marked absent.

31:55.320 --> 31:55.340
Okay.

31:55.460 --> 31:56.160
