32:14.420 --> 32:14.880
SGD. The paper

32:14.880 --> 32:16.200
delineates three distinct

32:16.200 --> 32:17.260
fault model regimes

32:17.260 --> 32:18.680
for mathematical verification.

32:19.500 --> 32:19.980
Regime one

32:19.980 --> 32:21.180
