32:24.520 --> 32:25.320
Which is, I mean,

32:25.380 --> 32:26.000
standard practice

32:26.000 --> 32:27.080
inside a closed

32:27.080 --> 32:28.440
corporate cluster, sure.

32:28.600 --> 32:29.740
But that's entirely

32:29.740 --> 32:30.420
unacceptable

32:30.420 --> 32:31.440
in a decentralized

32:31.440 --> 32:33.140
Byzantine environment

32:33.140 --> 32:34.320
where nodes might

32:34.320 --> 32:35.220
actually have financial

32:35.220 --> 32:36.100
incentives to poison

32:36.100 --> 32:36.540
the model.

32:36.860 --> 32:37.240
SGD. Exactly.

32:37.660 --> 32:38.560
Which brings us

32:38.560 --> 32:39.840
to regime two.

32:40.260 --> 32:41.840
This forces the leaf nodes

32:41.840 --> 32:42.980
