33:05.340 --> 33:06.420
to avoid in the first place.

33:06.540 --> 33:06.840
Right.

33:07.180 --> 33:07.820
Which leaves

33:07.820 --> 33:08.920
regime three,

33:09.500 --> 33:11.120
relying on cryptographic proofs.

33:11.540 --> 33:12.620
A relay node

33:12.620 --> 33:13.480
