33:56.680 --> 33:57.800
totally costless

33:57.800 --> 33:58.760
cryptographic proofs

33:58.760 --> 33:59.280
for the math,

33:59.480 --> 34:01.140
we still hit the final,

34:01.540 --> 34:02.340
sobering limitation

34:02.340 --> 34:03.000
of the certificate.

34:03.580 --> 34:04.120
Yeah, the paper

34:04.120 --> 34:05.160
makes it brutally clear.

